      "text": "      187 = 10111011\n      240 = 11110000\n187 & 240 = 10110000 = 176\n187 | 240 = 11111011 = 251\n187 ^ 255 = 01000100 = 68\n240 ^ 255 = 00001111 = 15",
      "originalText": "      187 = 10111011\n      240 = 11110000\n187 & 240 = 10110000 = 176\n187 | 240 = 11111011 = 251\n187 ^ 255 = 01000100 = 68\n240 ^ 255 = 00001111 = 15",
